# Login / background items that are EXPECTED to be enabled
# (System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions). macconfig-check.sh ("Mac health")
# warns about any enabled item that is neither listed here nor approved by an MDM
# Service Management rule (Fleet pushes those; lib/btm-login-items.py reads them from
# the BTM store). An MDM rule may not name every helper, so SentinelOne, Santa,
# Formal, koi, the Zoom daemon and Chrome are listed here too. A new item whose
# team id is already on an MDM Service Management rule is not told to turn off:
# add that item to this list. Items whose app no longer
# exists are always flagged as stale, even if listed.
#
# Format (pipe-delimited): type | value | note
#   type:  team          Apple Team ID (all of that developer's items)
#          bundle        bundle id (also covers login items/agents inside that app)
#          label         launchd label (LaunchAgents / LaunchDaemons)
#          label-prefix  launchd label prefix
#          app           full path of an app under Open at Login (~ is your home
#                        folder). Only that app matches, and only as an
#                        open-at-login app. For an app whose bundle id differs on
#                        each Mac, such as a Safari web app
#                        (com.apple.Safari.WebApp.<UUID>). Other web apps stay
#                        unexpected
# See what's enabled now: python3 lib/btm-login-items.py --audit lib/login-items-allow.list
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.

# ---- Tools this repo sets up (Brewfile / links.list) ----
team|G43BCU2T37|Karabiner-Elements agents and daemons (Core-Service, VirtualHIDDevice)
bundle|org.hammerspoon.Hammerspoon|Hammerspoon opens at login (Slack on the ARZOPA display, Finder hotkey)
bundle|com.raycast.macos|Raycast opens at login
team|QED4VVPZWA|Logi Options+ agents and updater
bundle|com.mitchellh.ghostty|Ghostty opens at login
bundle|com.granola.app|Granola opens at login
bundle|com.tinyspeck.slackmacgap|Slack opens at login
bundle|com.anysphere.sand|Grok Bot opens at login (/Applications/Grok Bot.app; replaced the stale 'Sand' entry)
bundle|com.spotify.client.startuphelper|Spotify StartUpHelper: opens Spotify at login (kept on purpose)
app|~/Applications/WhatsApp Web.app|WhatsApp Web opens at login (Safari web app, manual step whatsapp-web; its bundle id is new on each Mac)
label-prefix|com.microsoft.teams2|Microsoft Teams agent (cask microsoft-teams)
team|X4QN7LTP59|Multipass daemon (cask multipass)
label|com.pdone.pin-dictation-hotkey-164|this repo's LaunchAgent (launchagents/)

