bundle|com.sentinelone.sentineld-guard|SentinelOne daemon guard
bundle|com.sentinelone.sentineld-helper|SentinelOne daemon helper
bundle|com.sentinelone.sentineld-shell|SentinelOne daemon shell
bundle|com.sentinelone.sentinel-extensions|SentinelOne extensions
team|ZMCG7MLDV9|Santa
bundle|com.northpolesec.santa|Santa
bundle|com.northpolesec.santa.bundleservice|Santa bundle service
bundle|com.northpolesec.santa.syncservice|Santa sync service
bundle|com.northpolesec.santa.metricservice|Santa metric service
team|H2YVZWCZNF|Formal
bundle|com.formal.desktop|Formal
label-prefix|koi.security.|koi security MDM (koi.security.*, including the koi.security.mdm.sh daemon and koi.security.mdm.plist). Company MDM items stay on. Do not turn them off
team|BJ4HAAB9B3|Zoom daemon
bundle|us.zoom.ZoomDaemon|Zoom daemon
team|EQHXZ8M8AV|Google Chrome, including its background updater
bundle|com.google.Chrome|Google Chrome
team|2BUA8C4S2C|1Password launcher and browser helper (Fleet Self service)
bundle|com.okta.mobile|Okta Verify opens at login (Fleet Self service)
# Tailscale has no launch-at-login switch of its own. It is added under
# Open at Login (/Applications/Tailscale.app from Fleet). Team W5364U7YZB
# covers the app, its login-item helper, and the network extension. The
# bundle rows cover a record that has no team id.
team|W5364U7YZB|Tailscale (Fleet), including its login item and network extension
bundle|io.tailscale.ipn.macsys|Tailscale opens at login
bundle|io.tailscale.ipn.macos|Tailscale Mac App Store build, if that app is the one installed
bundle|io.tailscale.ipn.macsys.login-item-helper|Tailscale login item helper
team|6KKW3K37TU|Cyberhaven
team|Z2FDA4QHGU|Phorion EDR
team|8VBZ3948LU|Fleet orbit
label|com.pdone.pin-quicknote-hotkey-190|this repo's LaunchAgent (launchagents/)

# Cursor and Cursor Nightly each register a BackgroundActivityCheck agent.
# The app bundle id also covers a helper stored inside that app. The helper's
# own bundle id and launchd label are listed too, so the agent is allow-listed
# whichever way the BTM store records it.
bundle|com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92|Cursor (stable), including its BackgroundActivityCheck helper
bundle|co.anysphere.cursor.nightly|Cursor Nightly, including its BackgroundActivityCheck helper
bundle|com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92.BackgroundActivityCheck|Cursor BackgroundActivityCheck helper
bundle|co.anysphere.cursor.nightly.BackgroundActivityCheck|Cursor Nightly BackgroundActivityCheck helper
label-prefix|com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92.BackgroundActivityCheck|Cursor BackgroundActivityCheck launch agent
label-prefix|co.anysphere.cursor.nightly.BackgroundActivityCheck|Cursor Nightly BackgroundActivityCheck launch agent
